      "range": "2488-2506",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "直接选择市场上所有人都最看好的股票。",
      "totalCount": 1287
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 505613057,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_56_3442-3481",
      "chapterUid": 56,
      "range": "3442-3481",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "自己没能力就说没能力，怎么你到哪儿，哪都大环境不好，你就是个破坏大环境的人啊！",
      "totalCount": 1287
    },
    {
