      "bookmarkId": "27525171_62_2255-2274",
      "chapterUid": 62,
      "range": "2255-2274",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一切的真相都没有任何义务照顾你的情绪。",
      "totalCount": 1105
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 28932201,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_62_3611-3699",
      "chapterUid": 62,
      "range": "3611-3699",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "那些误以为过去必然影响将来的人其实更可怜。赌场上的赌徒，因为不懂独立事件的概念而陷入赌徒谬误，输掉的仅仅是他当时的赌资而已，而那些相信过去必然影响将来的人们，直接输掉的是未来！",
      "totalCount": 1050
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 217127309,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_64_4075-4088",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "4075-4088",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你要与家人有着共同的理想。",
      "totalCount": 1050
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 240040986,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_49_3428-3461",
      "chapterUid": 49,
      "range": "3428-3461",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不做不要读，读了就必须做，做了不会马上有结果，长期做必然有好结果。",
      "totalCount": 988
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 323107019,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_68_548-593",
      "chapterUid": 68,
      "range": "548-593",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "决定一个人富有的三个条件，一是出身，二是运气，三是努力；而这三者之中，努力是最微不足道的。",
      "totalCount": 975
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 18140085,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_52_4259-4295",
      "chapterUid": 52,
      "range": "4259-4295",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "定投是长期持续投入的行为，所以，投资标的必须满足“长期不断看涨”的属性。",
      "totalCount": 968
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 289347801,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_58_2615-2692",
      "chapterUid": 58,
      "range": "2615-2692",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "决定命运的关键性因素常常在主动边界之外。主动边界之外最关键的因素是什么呢？一个词而已：趋势。",
      "totalCount": 936
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 75879522,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_66_3917-3966",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "3917-3966",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "赚到很多钱的意义在哪里？不就是为了保证自己去干自己喜欢干的事情的时候不被外界打扰吗？",
      "totalCount": 912
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 921980191,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_50_4644-4658",
      "chapterUid": 50,
      "range": "4644-4658",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "参与定投社区一定是最优策略。",
      "totalCount": 876
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 13160937,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_66_2222-2245",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "2222-2245",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "为自己想做的、正在做的事情拼命赋予伟大的意义。",
      "totalCount": 860
    },
    {
      "bookId": "27525171",
      "userVid": 60452254,
      "bookmarkId": "27525171_67_5936-5958",
      "chapterUid": 67,
      "range": "5936-5958",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "无论什么，要么不做，只要决定做，就要做全套。",
      "totalCount": 798
    },
    {
